sis="" /></token></sentence></text_ojb></paragraph><paragraph num="5" page_ojb="60" page_eng="61"><text_eng> That oldest one is still going around making noise in  search of her little sister. </text_eng><text_ojb><sentence num="1"><sent_text>Mii sa a'aw zeziikizid geyaabi go babaa-nandawewemaad iniw oshiimeyan.</sent_text><token word="mii"><fst_output lemma="mii" analysis="mii+ADVPred" /></token><token word="sa"><fst_output lemma="sa" analysis="PCDisc" /></token><token word="a'aw"><fst_output lemma="a'aw" analysis="PRONDem+a'aw+NA+ProxSg" /></token><token word="zeziikizid"><fst_output lemma="zaziikizi" analysis="ChCnj+zaziikizi+VAI+Cnj+Pos+Neu+3SgProxSubj" /><fst_output lemma="zaziikizi" analysis="zaziikizi+VAI+Pcp+Pos+Neu+3SgProxSubj+3SgProxHead" /></token><token word="geyaabi"><fst_output lemma="geyaabi" analysis="geyaabi+ADVTmp" /></token><token word="go"><fst_output lemma="go" analysis="PCDisc" /></token><token word="babaa-nandawewemaad"><fst_output lemma="andawewem" analysis="PVDir/babaa+andawewem+VTA+Cnj+Pos+Neu+3SgProxSubj+3PlObvObj" /><fst_output lemma="andawewem" analysis="PVDir/babaa+andawewem+VTA+Cnj+Pos+Neu+3SgProxSubj+3SgObvObj" /></token><token word="iniw"><fst_output lemma="iniw" analysis="PRONDem+iniw+NA+ObvSg" /><fst_output lemma="iniw" analysis="PRONDem+iniw+NA+ObvPl" /></token><token word="oshiimeyan"><fst_output lemma="shiimey" analysis="shiimey+NAD+ObvSg+3SgProxPoss" /><fst_output lemma="shiimey" analysis="shiimey+NAD+ObvPl+3SgProxPoss" /></token><token word="."><fst_output lemma="." analysis="" /></token></sentence></text_ojb></paragraph></chapter><chapter num="19" ojb_title="Ikwe Miinawaa Ogwizisan" eng_title="The Woman and Her Son" transcriber="Gilles Delisle"><chapter_speaker name1="Rose Foss" name2="" affiliation="Mille Lacs" birthdate="" gender="" /><paragraph num="1" page_ojb="72" page_eng="73"><text_eng> A certain woman always abandoned her son. To no  avail, that boy was always crying. That mother of his never  listened to him. Truly that boy was always left behind.  </text_eng><text_ojb><sentence num="1"><sent_text>Bezhig ikwe apane ogii-naganaan ogwizisensan.</sent_text><token word="bezhig"><fst_output lemma="bezhig" analysis="bezhig+NUM" /></token><token word="ikwe"><fst_output lemma="ikwe" analysis="ikwe+NA+ProxSg" /></token><token word="apane"><fst_output lemma="apane" analysis="apane+ADVTmp" /></token><token word="ogii-naganaan"><fst_output lemma="nagazh" analysis="PVTense/gii+nagazh+VTA+Ind+Pos+Neu+3SgProxSubj+3PlObvObj" /><fst_output lemma="nagazh" analysis="PVTense/gii+nagazh+VTA+Ind+Pos+Neu+3SgProxSubj+3SgObvObj" /></token><token word="ogwizisensan"><fst_output lemma="gwizis" analysis="gwizis+NAD+Dim+ObvPl+3SgProxPoss" /><fst_output lemma="gwizis" analysis="gwizis+NAD+Dim+ObvSg+3SgProxPoss" /></token><token word="."><fst_output lemma="." analysis="" /></token></sentence><sentence num="2"><sent_text>Mii go apane gii-aano-mookawaakiid a'aw gwiiwizens.</sent_text><token word="mii"><fst_output lemma="mii" analysis="mii+ADVPred" /></token><token word="go"><fst_output lemma="go" analysis="PCDisc" /></token><token word="apane"><fst_output lemma="apane" analysis="apane+ADVTmp" /></token><token word="gii-aano-mookawaakiid"><fst_output lemma="mookawaakii" analysis="PVTense/gii+PVTense/aano+mookawaakii+VAI+Cnj+Pos+Neu+3SgProxSubj" /></token><token word="a'aw"><fst_output lemma="a'aw" analysis="PRONDem+a'aw+NA+ProxSg" /></token><token word="gwiiwizens"><fst_output lemma="gwiiwizens" analysis="gwiiwizens+NA+ProxSg" /></token><token word="."><fst_output lemma="." analysis="" /></token></sentence><sentence num="3"><sent_text>Gaawiin ogii-pizindaagoosiin iniw omaamaayan.</sent_text><token word="gaawiin"><fst_output lemma="gaawiin" analysis="gaawiin+ADVNeg" /></token><token word="ogii-pizindaagoosiin"><fst_output lemma="ogii-pizindaagoosiin" analysis="" /></token><token word="iniw"><fst_output lemma="iniw" analysis="PRONDem+iniw+NA+ObvSg" /><fst_output lemma="iniw" analysis="PRONDem+iniw+NA+ObvPl" /></t